Parts of the repository carry their own licences:

- The artist's models and art (art/) are under an open licence named in art/LICENSE.md once it
  is chosen (D20).
- City map data is derived from OpenStreetMap, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the
  Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0, with building heights from Overture Maps (ODbL) and homes, jobs
  and commutes from the U.S. Census Bureau; the baked city files are published under the ODbL.
  LICENSE-DATA.md lists every source, its licence and its credit.
- The Afacad Flux font, built by scripts/fonts/, is (c) 2023 The Afacad Project Authors under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1; its licence text ships with the game.
- Third-party libraries keep their own licences, listed with their texts in
  public/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt (generated by scripts/notices.mjs).
